[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3269878787","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110344#issuecomment-3269878787","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110344","id":3269878787,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7C5mQD","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-09T09:55:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-09T09:55:44Z","body":"I'm getting exactly opposite result:\n```gdscript\n\tclampi(-10, INF, 0) # --> 9223372036854775807\n\tclampi(10, 0, INF) # --> 10\n```\n\n`INF` only make sense when used with floats and undefined behavior for ints.\n\nFor ints use max/min `int64_t` values (`-2^63` to `2^63 - 1`, seems like there are no GDScript constants for it):\n```gdscript\n\tclampi(-10, -9223372036854775808, 0) # --> -10\n\tclampi(10, 0, 9223372036854775807) # --> 10\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3269878787/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3269919956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110344#issuecomment-3269919956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110344","id":3269919956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7C5wTU","user":{"login":"MarkoGrbec","id":112959637,"node_id":"U_kgDOBruglQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112959637?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec","html_url":"https://github.com/MarkoGrbec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkoGrbec/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-09T10:05:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-09T10:11:31Z","body":"I guess it has to do something with the CPU than.\n\nif we both get the opposite result on clampi\n\nWOA\n```\n2**64-1 # --> 9223372036854775807\n2**64 # --> -9223372036854775808\n```\nwhy do I get opposite values here?\n\n`2**63` gives me same result","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3269919956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3869683189","html_url":"h